---
title: Downloads
pagetitle: Downloads
description: 'Downloads der Fahrschule Guth Bochum: Checkliste zur Auswahl der richtigen Fahrschule, Flyer und Unterlagen zum Führerschein mit 17.'
subnav: ueberuns
breadcrumb_parents:
  - { label: Über Uns, href: /ueberuns/ }
---
<%= partial "partials/page_header" %>
<section class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-5xl px-4">
  <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold">Unsere <span class="text-primary">Downloads</span>!</h2>
  <ul class="card-glass mt-4 divide-y divide-base-content/10 rounded-box">
    <% data.links.downloads.each do |d| %>
      <li class="flex flex-col gap-1 px-5 py-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
        <span class="font-semibold"><%= d.name %></span>
        <a class="link link-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm" href="<%= d.url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="<%= d.name %>"><%= icon :download, css: "size-4" %> <%= d.name %></a>
      </li>
    <% end %>
  </ul>
</section>
